Niba ufite ikibazo cyangwa inyunganizi kuri aya mabwiriza ya kuki cyangwa ushaka gukoresha uburenganzira uhabwa n'Itegeko nº 058/2021, twandikire ku biro bishinzwe umutekano w'amakuru:

• Urwego Rushinzwe Amakuru: MyJudicial Ltd
• Email y'Ushinzwe Kurinda Amakuru (DPO): {{dpoEmail}}
• Email y'Ubufasha muri Rusange: {{supportEmail}}
• Terefone ya Hotline: {{hotlinePhone}}
• Ibiro Bikuru: {{officeAddress}}
• Agasanduku k'Iposita: {{poBox}}
• Amasaha y'Akazi: {{workingHours}}

Ku bindi bisobanuro birambuye by'uburyo dufata amakuru bwite, sura Politiki y'Ibanga (Privacy Policy).

Iyi Politiki y'Ibanga igenga ikusanywa, itunganywa n'irindwa ry'amakuru bwite muri serivisi zose za MyJudicial, zirimo:

• Gushakisha abavoka, gukoresha ikarita y'aho bakorera, no gusura imyirondoro yabo;
• Kuzuza ifishi y'ikibazo cy'amategeko no gukoresha ubufasha bwa AI mu kumenya ibyiciro by'ikibazo;
• Guhitamo igihe cyo guhura n'umwunganizi no gukoresha amashusho (LiveKit video);
• Uburyo bwo kubika amafaranga y'ubujyanama mu buryo bwizewe (escrow) kugeza serivisi irangiye;
• Ububiko bw'inyandiko z'ibanga zifunze n'imfunguzo z'ikoranabuhanga (OCI Object Storage);
• Kumenyekanisha imyirondoro no kugenzura ibyangombwa by'abavoka bo mu Rugaga rw'Abavoka.

Ikitonderwa: Iyi politiki ireba ibikorwa by'ikoranabuhanga bya MyJudicial. Iyo ushyize umukono ku masezerano yo kwunganirwa n'umwavoka mu nkiko cyangwa mu zindi nzego, uwo mwavoka agengwa n'amahame y'umwuga w'ubuvoka n'ibanga ry'umwuga (professional secrecy) by'Urugaga rw'Abavoka mu Rwanda.

NTA MYANZURO Y'AMATEGEKO IFATWA N'IKORANABUHANGA MU BURYO BWIKORA: MyJudicial ntabwo ifata imyanzuro yikora ifite ingaruka z'amategeko ku mukoresha (nk'urugero gufunga konti mu buryo bwikora cyangwa kumwima serivisi bitanyuze mu muntu).

Uburyo bwo gutoranya no gushyira ku murongo abavoka: Iyo ushakishije abavoka, urubuga rukoresha uburyo busobanutse bw'imibare mu kubashyira ku murongo ukurikije:

1. Guhura kw'ikibazo n'ubumenyi bw'umwavoka (40%): Uko ikibazo cyawe gihuye n'ubumenyi umwavoka afite;
2. Amanota yahawe n'abandi bakiriya (25%): Amanota umwavoka yahawe n'abamugishije inama mbere;
3. Guhuza n'ingengo y'imari (15%): Uko ibiciro by'umwavoka bihuye n'amafaranga wifuza gukoresha;
4. Umubare w'abatanze amanota (10%): Umubare w'abakiriya bamaze kumugisha inama bakamuha amanota;
5. Imyaka y'ubunararibonye (5%): Igihe amaze akora umwuga w'ubuvoka mu Rugaga;
6. Ishami ry'amategeko akoramo cyane (5%): Niba amategeko y'ikibazo ariyo asanzwe yibandaho cyane.

Uburenganzira bwawe bwo guhitamo: Ubu buryo bukoreshwa gusa mu kugufasha kubona abavoka ku murongo. Ufite uburenganzira bwuzuye bwo guhitamo umwavoka uwo ari we wese ushaka kuri uru rubuga.

Aho seriveri ziri: Kugira ngo urubuga rurusheho kugira umutekano wizewe, ubushobozi bwo kudahagarara, n'ikoranabuhanga rigezweho, MyJudicial ikoresha amasosiyete akomeye ku rwego rw'isi afite seriveri ziherereye hanze y'u Rwanda:

• Ububiko bw'amakuru n'imyirondoro: Supabase / Amazon Web Services (AWS) ziri mu Muryango w'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi (EU) no muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika (USA);
• Ububiko bw'inyandiko zifunze (Vault): Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) iri muri USA no muri EU;
• Amashusho yo kugisha inama: LiveKit Cloud ifite seriveri ku isi yose;
• Kohereza imeri na SMS: Brevo ifite seriveri mu Muryango w'Ubumwe bw'Uburayi (EU);
• Ububiko bwihuse: Upstash Redis iri muri EU no muri USA.

Kubahiriza Itegeko ry'u Rwanda: Dukurikije Ingingo ya 40, 41, n'iya 42 z'Itegeko nº 058/2021, kohereza amakuru hanze y'u Rwanda bikorwa hakurikijwe amasezerano akomeye yo kurinda amakuru (Data Processing Agreements), amakuru akaba afunze mu buryo bw'ikoranabuhanga (encryption), kandi bikaba ari ngombwa kugira ngo dusohoze amasezerano ya serivisi dufitanye nawe (Ingingo ya 42).

Ku bibazo byose byerekeye iyi Politiki y'Ibanga cyangwa gukoresha uburenganzira bwawe buteganywa n'Itegeko nº 058/2021, watwandikira ukoresheje imyirondoro ikurikira:

